## The first unproved theorem, stated exactly

Unchanged since G12:

> **`literalCompensatedAnchorExplicitFormula`.**  For an actual zero
> `ρ = 1/2 + α + iγ` of `completedRiemannZeta` and the actual source local matrix
> at height `T` and window `H`, the literal anchored Gram defect `D_{ρ,H}` equals
> `C_src(T,H,ρ) · 𝒟^{prime}_N(α,t) + R_zero + R_EF`, with every object the
> literal source object `γ_ρ, τ_k, h = 2π/L, X = e^L, φ̂, m_ρ, A_H` and the exact
> explicit-formula normalization, and with `C_src` given in closed form.

It must produce `C_src · t² · N^{1+4|α|} < 1024c(log N)⁴/120000` in the literal
Weil normalization.  G16 adds that this cannot be achieved by any taper of the
class for which the source floor is proved, in any decay regime up to the
critical rate, and that the supercritical regime is empty for that class.  No
claim about the Riemann Hypothesis is made.
